<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>VoluntApp | Iniciar sesión</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg: #f4f8fb;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,.92);
      --text: #16324f;
      --muted: #6b7b8c;
      --blue: #156082;
      --blue-2: #0F9ED5;
      --green: #196B24;
      --green-2: #4EA72E;
      --orange: #E97132;
      --border: rgba(21, 96, 130, .16);
      --shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(16, 42, 67, .14);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15,158,213,.12), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(78,167,46,.10), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #eef6fb 0%, #f9fbfd 45%, #eef7f1 100%);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .shell {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1180px;
      min-height: 720px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
      border-radius: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      background: white;
    }

    .brand-panel {
      position: relative;
      padding: 40px;
      color: white;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(21,96,130,.94), rgba(15,158,213,.86)),
        url("../assets/img/fondo.png") center/cover no-repeat;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand-panel::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5,20,35,.16), rgba(5,20,35,.28));
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .brand-top,
    .brand-bottom {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .brand-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
      margin: 22px 0 12px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12));
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 500px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .brand-title span {
      color: #d9f7ff;
    }

    .brand-subtitle {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 520px;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.92);
    }

    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .stat {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .stat small {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .form-panel {
      padding: 40px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: var(--card);
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 470px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 34px;
    }

    .card-header {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .10em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--blue);
      background: rgba(21,96,130,.08);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .card-header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .card-header p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .field {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .field label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: .95rem;
      color: #24415d;
    }

    .input {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1.5px solid #d9e4ec;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 15px 16px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: .2s ease;
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    .input:focus {
      border-color: rgba(15,158,213,.95);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(15,158,213,.12);
      background: white;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 12px 0 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .remember {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .94rem;
    }

    .link {
      color: var(--blue);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, opacity .15s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(21,96,130,.18);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--blue-2));
    }

    .helper {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: .95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
    }

    #mensaje {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: .86rem;
      color: #7a8998;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .footer-note strong {
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .shell {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .brand-panel {
        min-height: 420px;
      }

      .stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      body { padding: 12px; }
      .brand-panel,
      .form-panel { padding: 22px; }
      .card { padding: 24px; border-radius: 22px; }
      .card-header h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
      .brand-logo { width: 92px; height: 92px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="shell">
    <section class="brand-panel">
      <div class="brand-top">
        <div class="brand-badge">VoluntApp • Gestión de voluntariado</div>
        <img class="brand-logo" src="../assets/img/logo.png" alt="Logo VoluntApp">
        <h2 class="brand-title">Conectando corazones, <span>creando cambios</span></h2>
        <p class="brand-subtitle">
          Una plataforma moderna para organizar voluntarios, actividades e inscripciones con una experiencia simple, clara y confiable.
        </p>

        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>+ Voluntarios</strong>
            <small>Gestión centralizada y acceso por roles.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>+ Actividades</strong>
            <small>Control de eventos, cupos e inscripciones.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>+ Impacto</strong>
            <small>Coordinación eficiente para la comunidad.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="brand-bottom">
        <p style="margin:0; position:relative; z-index:1; opacity:.95;">
          <strong>VoluntApp</strong> · Bienvenido a la comunidad de voluntarios más grande de todos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="form-panel">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="eyebrow">Inicio de sesión</div>
          <h1>Accede a tu cuenta</h1>
          <p>Ingresa tus credenciales para continuar en la plataforma.</p>
        </div>

        <form id="loginForm" autocomplete="off">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Usuario</label>
            <input class="input" type="email" id="email" placeholder="test@voluntapp.com" required>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="password">Password</label>
            <input class="input" type="password" id="password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
          </div>

          <div class="actions">
            <label class="remember">
              <input type="checkbox">
              Recordarme
            </label>

            <a class="link" href="#">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</a>
          </div>

          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Iniciar Sesión</button>

          <p id="mensaje"></p>

          <div class="helper">
            ¿Aún no formas parte de nosotros? <a class="link" href="#">Únetenos</a>
          </div>

          <div class="footer-note">
            Al hacer clic, aceptas nuestros <strong>Términos de Servicio</strong>.
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="../assets/js/login.js"></script>
</body>
</html>